-Hant"],[["100%純煮干清湯拉麵是丸宗新的靈感嘗試，平子、潤目、白口（伊吹），背黑3種（長崎、富山、千葉），有別於之前乾物拉麵，100%純煮干清湯拉麵只以煮干營造出湯頭層次，以醬油帶出甜味，難度更高的挑戰。承襲丸宗自慢且不凡的清湯底蘊，同樣是淡麗清爽不膩口的口感表現，第一口有如老闆說的大人的口味在微微的苦後慢慢的帶出煮干的香氣與鹹鮮，第二口轉換微苦直接反映出更突出的醬油煮干存粹的甘甜很有樂趣，由於是清湯不膩口，洋蔥碎轉味解膩的作用相較於濃厚煮干比較不明顯但甜味十足，這是完成度蠻高的一杯，建議老闆可以以更強烈的煮干「苦後甘甜」的特色（有如吃秋刀魚的魚乾一般）搭配明亮的清湯風格將這碗100%純煮干清湯拉麵定性為風格獨樹一幟個性明顯「成熟的大人口味」。鮮蝦雲吞薑味非常鮮香完美的調和豬肉和鮮蝦的鮮甜，鮮蝦表現十足的脆口口感，鮮、香、脆一點不孤單，超大一顆十分滿足，我相信老闆的這一杯靈感會持續進化，丸宗從來都不曾讓我這位拉麵愛好者失望…..讚讚讚。",null,[0,240]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/9865792926643707628/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkllRTF1YmsxUkVBRRAB"]],[null,null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/@/data\u003d!4m7!23m6!1m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIeE1ubk1REAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xbc1ec1a1f41996c0!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICHxMnnMQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIeE1ubk1REAE\u0026t\u003d3\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNIeE1ubk1REi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0h4TW5uc1FFEhNDZ3dJMU1EUXRnWVE4STZvaVFNIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARwJYZ9KHBHrwqCzBhcDEwSmw5VlNr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjLoqGjs9eWAxX2ka8BHQcnG_oQoykIpgMoCQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjD5aqjs9eWAxW_eV4EHf91CNYQ0pMFCMoCKA4"],null,null,nul